# Copy to .env and fill in to enable Claude's qualitative analysis.
# Without this, the app still runs — it just shows the quantitative model only.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional: SimFin API key for cleaner fundamentals on names SEC EDGAR doesn't
# cover, e.g. foreign filers (free tier = 5yr history + 500 credits/mo; $15/mo =
# 10yr+). Falls back to Yahoo automatically. The bulk screener always uses Yahoo.
SIMFIN_API_KEY=

# Optional: User-Agent for SEC EDGAR (the primary, free source of 10–19yr as-filed
# fundamentals — no key needed). SEC fair-access asks for a descriptive UA with a
# contact; their documented format is "Company Name your@email". The default works,
# but set your own contact here if you'll be hitting EDGAR at volume.
SEC_EDGAR_UA=
